    steps: [
      { title: 'OSC B as a fast modulator', module: 'osc', why: 'OSC B is set up as a fast, silent modulator. Its high, detuned pitch will produce harsh, inharmonic overtones in the next step.\n- OSC B FREQUENCY 10 (+2 oct): fully up, two octaves above OSC A.\n- OSC B FINE +70 cents: an uneven ratio, so the overtones clash rather than blend.\n- OSC B pulse on: added to the sawtooth that is already on, giving a sharper wave.\n- OSC B LEVEL 0: not heard, but it keeps running.\n- Listen for: no change yet: OSC B is silent and not routed.',
        set: { 'osc2.freq': 10, 'osc2.fine': 3.5, 'osc2.level': 0, 'osc2.pulse': true } },
      { title: 'Poly-Mod everywhere', module: 'mod', why: 'Poly-Mod, the Prophet’s name for modulation inside each voice, sends OSC B to OSC A’s pitch and to the filter at audio speed. That frequency modulation creates clanging overtones like struck metal.\n- OSC B amount 7.5 (75 %): a lot. How harsh and metallic it gets.\n- FREQ A on: OSC B bends OSC A’s pitch hundreds of times a second.\n- FILTER on: OSC B also shakes the cutoff, adding grit.\n- Listen for: a harsh, clangy drone in place of the sawtooth.',
        set: { 'pmod.oscb': 7.5, 'pmod.freqA': true, 'pmod.filter': true } },
      { title: 'A short hit', module: 'amp', why: 'A short envelope turns the drone into a hit, and the mixer and filter are set for bite.\n- Amplifier ATTACK 0, DECAY 270 ms: an instant start and, with SUSTAIN at 0, a quick fade. The length of each hit.\n- Amplifier RELEASE 140 ms: a short tail if you let go early.\n- OSC A LEVEL 7.5: above 5 it drives the filter harder for extra grit.\n- CUTOFF 6.6 (1.8 kHz), RESONANCE 3: bright with an edge.\n- Listen for: short, clanging hits like struck sheet metal.',
        set: { ...ENV('aenv', 0, 5.2, 0, 4.6), 'osc1.level': 7.5, 'vcf.cutoff': 6.6, 'vcf.res': 3 } },
    ],
    context: {
      'pmod.oscb': 'In this sound: how harsh and metallic the hit is.',
      'aenv.decay': 'In this sound: the length of each hit.',
    },
    tweaks: [
      { id: 'osc2.fine', try: 'Move across its range', hear: 'The metal changes pitch and colour, from tin can to gong.' },
    ],
