    tags: ['lead', 'electronic', '70s'], level: 2,
    blurb: 'A pure, whistling tone made by the filter alone.',
    how: 'Both oscillators are turned down: the only sound is the filter itself, whistling at full RESONANCE. With KEYBOARD on FULL the whistle follows the notes, so the filter plays in tune like a third oscillator.',
